Error [E0999]: A named marker group needs at least two members
  --> tests/ui/marker_group_single.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | marker Single = #[Inline]
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A group names a marker stack, not a marker alias or an empty rule
 Fix: Write the marker directly at its use site, or give the group at least two members
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0999
